<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="da">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Opret eller Log ind - Danmarks Donation</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/authentication.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-page">

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="nav-container">
            <div class="logo-section">
                <span class="logo-main">Danmarks Donation</span>
            </div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/campaigns">Sog</a>
                <a href="/campaigns">Projekter</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <main class="auth-wrapper">
        <div class="auth-grid">

            <section class="auth-col">
                <h2>Opret konto</h2>
                <p>Er du ny her? Opret en profil pa fa sekunder for at starte din egen indsamling eller stotte andre.</p>

                <form action="/signup" method="POST">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Vaelg brugernavn</label>
                        <input type="text" name="brugernavn" placeholder="Navn / Mailadresse" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Vaelg adgangskode</label>
                        <input type="password" name="kode" placeholder="Mindst 6 tegn" required>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-auth btn-secondary">Opret bruger</button>
                </form>
            </section>

            <div class="auth-divider"></div>

            <section class="auth-col">
                <h2>Log ind</h2>
                <p>Velkommen tilbage. Log ind for at se dine kampagner eller opdatere din profil.</p>

                <form action="/login" method="POST">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Brugernavn</label>
                        <input type="text" name="brugernavn" placeholder="navn / mailadresse" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Adgangskode</label>
                        <input type="password" name="kode" placeholder="Indtast din kode" required>
                    </div>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-auth">Log ind</button>
                    <div class="footer-links">
                        <a href="#" class="forgot-link">Glemt adgangskode?</a>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </section>

        </div>
    </main>

</body>
</html>
